Subject: [PATCH 47/48] Scyther and Pinsir wild in the National Park

In HeartGold they appear only in the Bug-Catching Contest. The National Park's
own grass now has Scyther (5%) and Pinsir (4%) at every time of day, in two of
Pidgey's and Hoothoot's slots, so the contest isn't needed for anything. Made by
tools/hack/park_bugs.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEYSk2h6k1E1jWo3cHd
